        "subject": "Need help with your payment?",
        "message": "=<div style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: auto; border: 1px solid #f2dede; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden;\">\n    <div style=\"background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;\">\n        <h1 style=\"color: #333333; margin: 0; font-size: 22px;\">We're here to help!</h1>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div style=\"padding: 30px; color: #444444; line-height: 1.6;\">\n        <p>Hi <strong>{{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.name }}</strong>,</p>\n        \n        <p>We noticed that you tried to make a payment of <strong>₦{{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.amount }}</strong> earlier today, but it didn't quite go through.</p>\n        \n        <div style=\"background-color: #fff9db; padding: 15px; border-left: 5px solid #fcc419; margin: 20px 0;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #856404;\">\n                <strong>Don't worry:</strong> This usually happens due to temporary bank network delays or card authorization limits. Your order hasn't been cancelled yet!\n            </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <p>If you'd like to try again, you can use the original payment link or click the button below to resume where you left off:</p>\n        \n        <div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;\">\n            <a href=\"RETRY_LINK_OR_SITE_URL\" style=\"background-color: #2c3e50; color: #ffffff; padding: 15px 30px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\">Resume My Order</a>\n        </div>\n        \n        <p><strong>Need a different payment method?</strong><br>\n        If your card continues to have issues, just reply to this email. We can also provide bank transfer details or alternative options to make it easier for you.</p>\n        \n        <hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee; margin: 25px 0;\">\n        \n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px;\">Thank you for choosing <strong>YourDomain</strong>.</p>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: bold; color: #00a859;\">— The Support Team</p>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div style=\"background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 15px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #999;\">\n        <p>Transaction Reference: {{ $json.Reference }}</p>\n    </div>\n</div>",
